---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions | Global CGPA"
  description="Terms and Conditions of use for Global CGPA website."
  canonical="https://globalcgpa.in/terms"
>
  <main class="max-w-[780px] mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500 mb-2">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing and using Global CGPA, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms & Conditions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">2. Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to maintain accurate university conversion formulas, all calculation results are provided for informational and estimation purposes only. Official grade transcripts and percentage certificates issued by your university registrar remain the sole authoritative reference.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Global CGPA shall not be held liable for any discrepancies, errors, or consequences resulting from reliance on the calculation outputs for official applications.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All site design, text, graphics, and underlying source code belong to Global CGPA unless otherwise specified.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
